                <pb facs="0800" n="784" sameAs="frus:frus1949v06/pg784"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>In a cablegram dated March 1, Mr. Bunche advised that the Egyptian garrison of
                    2,900 men at al-Faluja, with their military equipment and personal possessions,
                    had been evacuated across the Egyptian border, pursuant to Article 3 of the
                    Egyptian-Israeli armistice agreement. The text of his communication is printed
                    in United Nations, <hi rendition="#italic">Official Records of the Security
                        Council, Fourth Tear, Supplement for March 1949</hi>, page 7. Hereinafter,
                    these official records will be identified as SC,
                        <hi rendition="#italic">4th yr</hi>., with indication of date of
                    supplement.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
